  "title": "STM32CubIDE 1.19 crashes after MX Upgrade",
  "content": "<p>After upgrading MX to 6.18.0 when I run STM32CubIDE 1.19 it crashes when doing it’s upgrade check.</p><p>As it happens so fast I can’t actually see what is happening but managed to open the Preferences to set the Firmware Updater to Off Line Mode..</p><p>I am using 1.19 as I prefer the MX integration in CubeIDE.</p><p> </p><p>So be warned ;)</p><p> </p><p> </p>",
